== A. Lower bound: three wires on a tripod ==
D_*(1,1,1)            = 3 - 1/3 = 8/3
wire price (1,1,1)    = 3 wires x length 2 = 6
ratio                 = 9/4
AM-HM over three arms: (sum 1/a)^(-1) <= (sum a)/9, so D_* >= (8/9) sum a and
the ratio 2 sum a / D_* is at most 2 / (1 - 1/9) = 9/4
sqrt(lam) = 3 sqrt(lam - 2) at lam = 9/4: defect 0.0e+00

